# Mendocino additions — appended to the fork's .gitignore before pushing.
#
# This repository is PUBLIC. The signing key below is the one secret that must never
# reach it: with it, anyone could sign a custom.txt that redirects every agent in the
# fleet to a server of their choosing. It lives only on the build host.

mrc_signing_key.json
*signing_key*.json
custom.txt

# Build artefacts and local caches
